Summary:
- Completed focused batching fixes and tests for the two hotspots flagged by ClassSurgeon: src/components/Payments/PaymentCheckout.jsx and src/components/Forms/AsyncForm.jsx.
- Created PRs with code changes + tests. Ran focused and full CI runs. See results below.

Changed files & PRs:
- src/components/Payments/PaymentCheckout.jsx
  PR: https://github.com/example-org/example-repo/pull/432
