FlushSync usage (locations & justification):
- src/components/Payments/PaymentCheckout.jsx (single location)
  - Reason: third-party payment widget initializer expects certain DOM layout/attributes synchronously after toggling processing state; practical refactor impractical within 1-2 dev-days without larger widget isolation. Used flushSync sparingly and documented in code and PR description.
  - Tests cover behavior. Usage comment added where flushSync is used.

Remaining regressions / tickets (recommended backlog):
